{"title":"The Regressed Doctor Just Wanted to Live Quietly","synopsis":"Dokter bedah toraks, Lee Jinhyuk, telah mendedikasikan puluhan tahun hidupnya hanya untuk pasiennya. Namun, dia tidak bisa berada di sana untuk saat-saat terakhir ibunya sendiri, menghabiskan malam-malam tanpa tidur yang penuh dengan penyesalan. Namun, ketika ia terbangun, tiba-tiba saja bulan Februari 1998-kembali ke masa-masa magangnya! Di kehidupan keduanya, ia ingin mencurahkan waktunya sepenuhnya untuk keluarganya… Namun, apa pun yang dilakukannya, hidup tenang bukanlah sebuah pilihan!","alternative_title":"회귀 닥터는 조용히 살고 싶었다, Dokter Yang Hidup Kembali Agar Bisa Hidup Dengan Tenang","author":"Tauran, Haejun, BY","artist":"Drawways","genres":["Drama","Slice of Life","Supernatural"],"chapters":[{"id":"3d2d616f-811e-48e5-a23d-b28a14cd9c0c","number":"73","title":"Chapter 73","date":"2026-07-06","images":[]},{"id":"4a239ecf-7553-41d8-b854-349735994e4f","number":"72","title":"Chapter 72","date":"2026-06-23","images":[]},{"id":"7eef8d01-bd24-43d1-9a11-5e72ff684047","number":"71","title":"Chapter 71","date":"2026-06-16","images":[]},{"id":"8bffe8ac-6ac6-4d45-b0a2-b1ccc6ae3ed5","number":"70","title":"Chapter 70","date":"2026-06-13","images":[]},{"id":"62a19375-23fd-47cd-beae-95b28cfcb79f","number":"69","title":"Chapter 69","date":"2026-06-12","images":[]},{"id":"183494ef-a37e-4241-858b-70f2706076b6","number":"68","title":"Chapter 68","date":"2026-06-12","images":[]},{"id":"6b4e5bcf-c0bf-48f2-ba81-65bd7453d988","number":"67","title":"Chapter 67","date":"2026-05-26","images":[]},{"id":"d02d263d-08cb-478d-b9a7-bf97105a8e9f","number":"66","title":"Chapter 66","date":"2026-05-24","images":[]},{"id":"bed8197e-507b-4a1c-a393-7cd1ed59d87d","number":"65","title":"Chapter 65","date":"2026-05-18","images":[]},{"id":"bab04894-b29c-436b-ae08-49d3a8ccd875","number":"64","title":"Chapter 64","date":"2026-05-18","images":[]},{"id":"77225f04-dc86-4ebb-88c2-c46a39a2fd09","number":"63","title":"Chapter 63","date":"2026